  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 Wound</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> Self</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> 1-space-radius</p><p>You share the outrage of a dragon when injured in battle, letting loose your power to punish those who harm you.</p><p>When you suffer Damage, you can release a burst of Black Flame as a <strong>Free Action</strong>.</p><p>Make a <strong>6:1 Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check, with bonus dice equal to the amount of <strong>Damage</strong> you suffered.</p><p>Each success inflicts <strong>1 Damage</strong> on all enemies within <strong>1 space</strong> of you. This damage ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p>",
